    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h4 id="前言："><a href="#前言：" class="headerlink" title="前言："></a>前言：</h4><p>​题目出处为：<a href="https://crackmes.one/">crackmes</a> 比赛名为 Crackmes.one RE CTF 2026，虽然已经结束、我也没参加，但是你仍然能在网络上找到题目。</p><p>​是的，这是一个只有逆向的比赛（喜</p><p>​但是好难（悲</p><h3 id="1-Cryptpad"><a href="#1-Cryptpad" class="headerlink" title="1.Cryptpad"></a>1.Cryptpad</h3><p>RC4、密文结构分析；</p><p>题目提供了一个<code>cryptpad.exe</code>以及一个<code>flag.enc</code>。exe是一个加解密软件，解密功能被禁用但是保留了完整的代码。主要的加密&#x2F;解密过程在sub_4014EB中，很明显的RC4算法。</p><p>其中a3为1时为加密，a3为0时为解密；</p><p>加密时会在密文后添加[密文长度]+[8字节密钥]+[密钥长度]，解密时则读取这些信息进行解密。</p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br><span class="line">103</span><br><span class="line">104</span><br><span class="line">105</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c++">  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( a3 )<br>  &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( a3 != <span class="hljs-number">1</span> )<br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">MessageBoxA</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, MB_OK);<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>  &#123;<br>    count = *(_DWORD *)&amp;a1[a2 - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>];<br>    src = &amp;a1[a2 - <span class="hljs-number">1</span> - count];<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">qmemcpy</span>(dst, src, count);<br>    v5 = *((_DWORD *)src - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    *((_DWORD *)src - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    a2 = v5;<br>  &#125;<br>  v7 = a1;<br>  dst = dst;<br>  NumberOfBytesWritten = NumberOfBytesWritten;<br>LABEL_6:<br>  v10 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    *v7++ ^= *dst++;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( ++v10 == <span class="hljs-number">8</span> )<br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">goto</span> LABEL_6;<br>    --NumberOfBytesWritten;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( NumberOfBytesWritten );<br>  n256 = <span class="hljs-number">256</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    byte_403795[(<span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> __int8)-(<span class="hljs-type">char</span>)n256] = -(<span class="hljs-type">char</span>)n256;<br>    --n256;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( n256 );<br>  v12 = &amp;unk_403695;<br>  n256_1 = <span class="hljs-number">256</span>;<br>  n8 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( n8 &gt;= <span class="hljs-number">8</span> )<br>      n8 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    *v12++ = dst[n8++];<br>    --n256_1;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( n256_1 );<br>  v15 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  v16 = v12 - <span class="hljs-number">256</span>;<br>  v17 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  n256_2 = <span class="hljs-number">256</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">LOBYTE</span>(v15) = byte_403795[v17] + v16[v17] + v15;<br>    v19 = byte_403795[v17];<br>    byte_403795[v17] = byte_403795[v15];<br>    byte_403795[v15] = v19;<br>    ++v17;<br>    --n256_2;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( n256_2 );<br>  v20 = a1;<br>  v21 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  v22 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  v23 = a2;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    v33 = v23;<br>    v24 = (<span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> __int8)(v21 + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    v32 = v20;<br>    v25 = byte_403795[v24];<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">LOBYTE</span>(v22) = v25 + v22;<br>    v26 = byte_403795[v22];<br>    byte_403795[v24] = v26;<br>    byte_403795[v22] = v25;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">LOBYTE</span>(v24) = byte_403795[(<span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> __int8)(v25 + v26)] ^ a1[v21];<br>    v20 = v32;<br>    v32[v21++] = v24;<br>    v23 = v33 - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( v33 != <span class="hljs-number">1</span> );<br>  v27 = a1;<br>  dst_1 = dst;<br>  NumberOfBytesWritten_1 = NumberOfBytesWritten;<br>LABEL_20:<br>  v30 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span><br>  &#123;<br>    result = *dst_1 ^ *v27;<br>    *v27++ = result;<br>    ++dst_1;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( ++v30 == <span class="hljs-number">8</span> )<br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">goto</span> LABEL_20;<br>    --NumberOfBytesWritten_1;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> ( NumberOfBytesWritten_1 );<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( a3 == <span class="hljs-number">1</span> )<br>  &#123;<br>    dst_2 = &amp;a1[a2 - <span class="hljs-number">13</span> + RandomBufferLength];<br>    *(_DWORD *)dst_2 = a2;<br>    dst_2 += <span class="hljs-number">4</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">qmemcpy</span>(dst_2, dst, <span class="hljs-number">8u</span>);<br>    dst_2[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-number">8</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> RandomBufferLength + a2;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> result;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>没啥好说，厨子解决：</p><p><img src="/2026/06/23/3/1.png" alt="image-1"></p><h3 id="2-FLRSCRNSVR-SCR"><a href="#2-FLRSCRNSVR-SCR" class="headerlink" title="2.FLRSCRNSVR.SCR"></a>2.FLRSCRNSVR.SCR</h3><blockquote><p>The challenge binary is a Windows screensaver that contains light anti-analysis components. The screensaver configuration mode (<code>/c</code>) sets the registry value (the flag) that is decoded during regular screensaver execution.</p><p>Players need to reverse a custom encoding algorithm to unveil the challenge flag.</p></blockquote><p>？ 屏保软件逆向，简单异或、替换，难绷在于逆向时要看一堆不熟悉的API操作，flag检查逻辑不太明显。</p><p><code>sub_140001AE0</code>调用加密&amp;验证函数，检测到source 长度为25则进行验证：</p><p><code>sub_140001300</code>为加密，进行对换+异或;</p><p><code>sub_140001890</code>为验证，其中读取的伪代码：<code>wcscpy_s(Destination, 0x100uLL, aQj);</code></p><h3 id="3-RecordPlayer（FatMike-02）"><a href="#3-RecordPlayer（FatMike-02）" class="headerlink" title="3.RecordPlayer（FatMike_02）"></a>3.RecordPlayer（FatMike_02）</h3><p>逻辑修补 &#x2F; 简单异或</p><p><del>以为FatMike比FatMike_02简单的孩子们有福了（</del></p><blockquote><p>Something’s wrong with this record player - the music doesn’t sound quite right.<br>Your mission is to fix it. Don’t worry though, the technology here is pretty simple.  </p></blockquote><p>如题，我们获得了一个<code>RecordPlayer.exe</code>。正常运行会播放倒放的莫名其妙音乐，成功修补使其播放正常音乐则能获得flag。这题的难点依然在于软件本身较为庞大。</p><p>最简单的方式是通过找音频播放相关AIP来快速定位，ida打开后，import表中注意到有：</p><ul><li><strong>WINMM</strong>: <code>waveOutOpen</code>, <code>waveOutWrite</code>, <code>waveOutPrepareHeader</code> _音乐播放</li><li><strong>KERNEL32</strong>: <code>FindResourceW</code>, <code>LoadResource</code>, <code>LockResource</code> _资源加载</li></ul><p>很快便能锁定到<code>sub_140001F50</code>进行了音乐的加载：<code>ResourceW = FindResourceW(0LL, (LPCWSTR)lpName, L&quot;SOUND&quot;);</code></p><p><code>sub_1400020F0</code>则包含音乐播放相关操作。追踪调用链发现：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs C">sub_140001F50(v4, <span class="hljs-number">0x8Du</span>);<br>LOBYTE(v5) = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>sub_140003A00(*(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">80</span>), v5);<span class="hljs-comment">//使a+80+24 = 2*(v5 ^ 1) -1 = -1</span><br>LOBYTE(v6) = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>sub_140003A20(*(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">80</span>), v6);<span class="hljs-comment">//使a+80+29 = v6 = 1</span><br>sub_1400020F0(*(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">80</span>));<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>最关键的就是 <code>sub_140002310</code>；</p><p>这个函数的作用是：<strong>从音频数据源读取指定长度的样本，填充到输出缓冲区，同时维护一个哈希链用于完整性校验，并在特定条件下触发回调。</strong></p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c++"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( *(_BYTE *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">29</span>) )<span class="hljs-comment">//a1+29决定了是否摇晃</span><br> &#123;<br>   v9 = <span class="hljs-built_in">sub_140001E20</span>(a1);<br> &#125;<br> <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br> &#123;<br>   v10 = *(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">16</span>);<br>   v9 = *(_BYTE *)(v10 + *(_QWORD *)a1);<br>   v11 = *(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">24</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//而a1 + 24 为步进值，为1时才是正常播放；</span><br>   v12 = v10 + v11 &lt; <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>   v13 = v10 + v11;<br>   *(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">16</span>) = v13;<br>   v14 = *(<span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">8</span>);<br>   <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( v12 )<br>   &#123;<br>     *(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">16</span>) = (<span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span>)(v14 - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>   &#125;<br>   <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ( v13 &gt;= v14 )<br>   &#123;<br>     *(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">16</span>) = <span class="hljs-number">0LL</span>;<br>   &#125;<br>   ++*(_QWORD *)(a1 + <span class="hljs-number">32</span>);<br> &#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>综上所示，我们应当吧v5,v6都改为0，才能使a1+29,a1+24回归正常值使其正常播放。patch汇编指令：</p><p><img src="/2026/06/23/3/2.png" alt="image-20260430190050629"></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
