    <title>小白的frida入门</title>
    <link href="/2026/04/30/1/"/>
    <url>/2026/04/30/1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="1-安装-基础使用："><a href="#1-安装-基础使用：" class="headerlink" title="1.安装&amp;基础使用："></a>1.安装&amp;基础使用：</h3><p>可以参考文章：<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/justruofeng/article/details/138704001">安卓模拟器Frida环境搭建 （mumu+adb+frida）_mumu adb-CSDN博客</a></p><p><strong>需要注意的是</strong>：</p><p>1.frida版本问题需要结合自身情况选择</p><p>2.如果遇到<code>adb.exe: more than one device/emulator</code>情况可以使用<code>-s</code>解决（参考下文）</p><p>3.若在执行<code>frida-ps.exe</code>等命令时提示‘命令未找到’，需要将Python的Scripts目录（通常包含<code>frida-ps.exe</code>）以及adb工具所在的目录添加到系统的PATH环境变量中。</p><p>本人使用：Mumu模拟器v5.24.0， frida-server-17.9.1-android-x86_64，frida version：17.9.1</p><p>先跟文章走一遍后再继续以下内容</p><h4 id="使用："><a href="#使用：" class="headerlink" title="使用："></a>使用：</h4><p>我总结了实操部分（即彻底安装完成后Frida一般流程）</p><p>打开Mumu模拟器，运行你要hook的安卓应用。</p><p>打开你的 <em>第一个</em> 命令行，如下，运行命令后不要关闭</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">adb connect 127.0.0.1:16384<br>adb -s 127.0.0.1:16384 shell<br><br>su<br>cd /data/local/tmp/<br>//可以使用 ls 查看文件夹内容<br>chmod 777 frida-server-17.9.1-android-x86_64 //更换成你的版本喵<br>./frida-server-17.9.1-android-x86_64<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开你的<strong>第二个</strong>命令行：</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">adb -s 127.0.0.1:16384 forward tcp:27043 tcp:27043<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第三个命令行：</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">frida-ps.exe -U -a //获取目标程序Identifier<br>frida.exe -U -f com.example.challengemobile（你获取的Identifier） -l hook.js//HOOOOOOK!!!!<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-初级练手！"><a href="#2-初级练手！" class="headerlink" title="2.初级练手！"></a>2.初级练手！</h3><p>参考博客：<a href="https://chujian521.github.io/blog/2023/12/01/%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E9%92%A9%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7Frida%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/#%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99frida%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC">动态钩子工具Frida的入门学习 - X’s blog</a></p><p>此博客提供了一道安卓CTF题；Jadx打开可以看到重要的get_flag函数</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">package</span> com.ctf.test.ctf_100;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.os.Bundle;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.os.Debug;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.support.v7.app.AppCompatActivity;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.view.View;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.widget.Button;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> android.widget.TextView;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.util.Random;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">/* loaded from: classes.dex */</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">MainActivity</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">AppCompatActivity</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> has_gone_int;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> to_reach_int;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">native</span> String <span class="hljs-title function_">get_flag</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i)</span>;<br><span class="hljs-comment">//………………省略部分</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">btn2_onclick</span><span class="hljs-params">(View v)</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-type">TextView</span> <span class="hljs-variable">tv_result</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> (TextView) findViewById(R.id.tvResult);<br>        tv_result.setText(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&#123;Flag:&quot;</span> + get_flag(<span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.to_reach_int) + <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&#125;&quot;</span>);<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!Debug.isDebuggerConnected()) &#123;<br>            System.loadLibrary(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ctf&quot;</span>);<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>编辑如下hook.js；</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-title class_">Java</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">perform</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">x</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">x</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>)&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-title class_">Java</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">choose</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;com.ctf.test.ctf_100.MainActivity&#x27;</span>, &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-attr">onMatch</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> (<span class="hljs-params">instance</span>) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(instance.<span class="hljs-title function_">get_flag</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>));<span class="hljs-comment">//直接调用get_flag</span><br>        &#125;,<br>        <span class="hljs-attr">onComplete</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> (<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Done&#x27;</span>);<br>        &#125;<br>     &#125;);<br>    &#125;,<span class="hljs-number">1000</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//等待函数加载</span><br>&#125;);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2026/04/30/1/1.png" alt="image-20260430190050629"></p><p>成功获取Flag；</p><p>当然，这题还有不同解法，frida的功能除了调用函数外还有直接修改变量，达到类似IDA调试的效果</p><p>使用<code>instance.findViewById(0x7f0c0056).setClickable(true);</code>可以直接将题目中获取flag按钮改为可点击；</p><p><code>instance.to_reach_int.value = 10;</code>则是直接将题目中的目标值调小，轻松获取flag；</p><blockquote><p>这是因为 Frida 在访问 Java 字段时，返回的是一个 <strong>包装对象</strong>，而不是原始值。通过 <code>.value</code>属性来实际读写这个字段值。</p></blockquote><p>&#x2F;&#x2F;这次先学到这。我还需要补充很多Javascript和安卓层面的知识；</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
